## What each result will tell us

| Result | Meaning |
|---|---|
| Autoscaler `minNumReplicas` is 3 | The Console form set it. This is a setting, not load. |
| Min is 1 and `recommendedSize` or the current size is 3 | The autoscaler scaled out because CPU passed its target. Needs a look at load, and possibly a higher target or a larger machine type. |
| Some instances show `CREATING` with an error | Failed creations are counted in the size. Same capacity problem as before. |
| Stopped VMs counted in list 1 | The 2 old VMs are being counted as servers. They're not in the MIG. |

